  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">First Neighborhood Improvement Loan</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Primer Prstamo de Mejoramiento de Barrios</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Los objetivos del Programa son:(i) legalizar la propiedad de los lotes de los asentamientos (ii) proveer infraestructura pblica bsica y equipamiento urbano y comunitario (iii) fortalecer las organizaciones de vecinos y su capacidad para resolver temas relacionados con su hbitat(iv) ampliar la oferta de tierras urbanizables y viviendas de bajo costo.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the Program are: (i) to legalize the property rights (ii) to provide public basic infrastructure and urban and communities facilities (iii) to strengthen the neighborhoods organizations and their capacity to resolve issues related with their habitat. (iv) to increase the supply of urbanized land and low cost housing.</narrative>
  </description>
